WEBVTT

00:07:59.659 --> 00:08:01.668
why do we still see so much of it?

00:08:02.636 --> 00:08:05.560
I was curious, so we surveyed
people about this, too.

00:08:06.068 --> 00:08:08.934
The number one reason is stress.

00:08:08.958 --> 00:08:10.669
People feel overwhelmed.

00:08:11.849 --> 00:08:14.528
The other reason that people
are not more civil

00:08:14.552 --> 00:08:17.326
is because they're skeptical
and even concerned

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:19.980
about being civil or appearing nice.

00:08:20.004 --> 00:08:22.527
They believe they'll appear
less leader-like.

00:08:22.551 --> 00:08:25.487
They wonder: Do nice guys finish last?

00:08:26.042 --> 00:08:28.976
Or in other words: Do jerks get ahead?

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.303
(Laughter)